  "citation": "Gornitz V M; White T W; Daniels R C (1997): A Coastal Hazards Data Base for the U.S. West Coast (1997) (NDP-043C). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC); Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/SSR.NDP043C",
